<view class="lineup-returned-page"><image class="lineup-returned-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="lineup-returned-content"><view class="lineup-returned-nav"><text bindtap="back">‹</text><view><text>阵容退回</text><text>请按退回原因修改后重新提交</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="lineup-returned-loading">正在读取退回阵容…</view><block wx:else><view class="lineup-returned-match"><image src="{{match.homeLogo}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{match.divisionName}}</text><text>{{match.homeTeamName}}　VS　{{match.awayTeamName}}</text><text>◫ {{match.matchDate}}　|　⌑ {{match.venue}}</text></view></view><view class="lineup-returned-alert"><image src="/images/runtime/icons/brand-v2-13.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>裁判已退回本场阵容</text><text>退回原因：{{returnReason}}</text><text>退回时间：{{returnedAtText}}</text></view></view><view class="lineup-returned-card"><text>需修改内容</text><text>仅需修改以下项，其余阵容保持不变</text><view class="lineup-returned-player"><text>{{problemPlayer.jersey}}</text><text>{{problemPlayer.avatarText}}</text><view><text>{{problemPlayer.name}}</text><text>{{problemPlayer.position}}</text></view><button bindtap="edit">更换球员</button></view><view class="lineup-returned-confirm"><text>♟ 首发阵容（{{starterCount}}人）</text><text>首发{{starterCount}}人已确认　✓</text></view><view class="lineup-returned-confirm"><text>♟ 替补阵容（{{substituteCount}}人）</text><text>替补{{substituteCount}}人已确认　✓</text></view></view><view class="lineup-returned-tip">ⓘ 请在开赛前重新提交；开赛后阵容快照锁定，普通流程不可修改。</view><button bindtap="edit">重新提交阵容</button><button bindtap="history" class="lineup-returned-secondary">查看退回记录</button></block></view></view>
